WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.760
Hi, I’m Sabina.

2
00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:05.280
I work a little differently from most AI systems.

3
00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:09.120
Think of me like ChatGPT, but built around your company.

4
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:13.750
You teach me how your business works, give me responsibilities, and decide what I’m allowed

5
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:14.480
to handle.

6
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.680
My first job?

7
00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.840
Helping your company keep its word.

8
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.520
The callback someone promised.

9
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.360
The quote that needs to go out.

10
00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.800
All the work between “we’ll do it” and “it’s done.”

11
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:26.080
That’s the middle.

12
00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:30.270
With the access you approve, I help keep track of what was promised, who owns

13
00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:32.560
it, and what needs to happen next.

14
00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:35.680
But useful and authorized aren’t the same thing.

15
00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:37.360
I can prepare the payment.

16
00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:39.680
Approve it without QuickBooks authority?

17
00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:40.320
No.

18
00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:42.800
And no, I can’t promote myself.

19
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.960
That would rather defeat the point.

20
00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:49.280
Give me a little time with your company—and let your team teach me—and something more

21
00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:50.880
interesting starts to happen.

22
00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:53.440
I become your company’s own AI.

23
00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:57.990
Connecting conversations, decisions, customers, and outcomes.

24
00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:03.680
Helping your team understand what happened, what may be changing, and what deserves attention next.

25
00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:06.000
Owning the middle is where we start.

26
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.240
Then you decide what comes next.
